# Will the Seal Be Broken (Q003), kill with the item already held: the drop is already complete, so the
# kill gives nothing and says nothing, but with the other two items in the bag it still completes cond 2.
# Hand-written from the quest script (no reference trace).
character Darkling 16
class 31
script quest.Q003_WillTheSealBeBroken
item 1081 1082 1083 956
page default/30141.htm
page script/quest/Q003_WillTheSealBeBroken/
quest Q003_WillTheSealBeBroken <cond>=1 <state>=STARTED
hold 1081 1
hold 1082 1
hold 1083 1
npc beast 20031 Monster 40 0 0

kill beast
  S SystemMessage id=95 1:0 1:0
  S QuestList 3:0x80000003
  S ExShowQuestMark quest=3
  Q upsert Q003_WillTheSealBeBroken | <cond> | 2
  rows Q003_WillTheSealBeBroken <cond>=2 <state>=STARTED
  items 1081=1 1082=1 1083=1
